name issue_795_reverse_outage_mouth_to_ear
describe forward link healthy, feedback path down for 45 s: audio reaches the listener within 400 ms (video no longer waits 2 s in the pacer)
# #795 (Owner 2026-11-03: beyond libwebrtc M157, which is ~2.1 s late here too). Same link as
# issue_536_reverse_outage_45s. Before the fix (main), seeds 1-10: m2e p95 2041-2105 (mean 2070), video e2e p95
# mean 2307, pacer p95 mean 2245; libwebrtc M157 m2e mean 2070 (#792).
# After: m2e 293 354 296 367 296 312 331 325 358 298 (mean 323), video e2e mean 348, pacer mean 215.
seed 1
duration 120s
at 0s capacity=1000kbps delay=40ms queue=300ms
reverse at 0s delay=40ms
reverse at 20s down
reverse at 65s up
# The Tester's targets (#536): m2e < 400, video e2e < 1000.
expect audio.mouth_to_ear_p95_ms < 400
expect video.e2e_delay_p95_ms < 1000
